OVERVIEW: Visual regression testing — capture, compare, and approve screenshots.

USAGE: grantiva diff <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  capture                 Navigate to configured screens and capture
                          screenshots.
  compare                 Diff current captures against baselines.
  approve                 Promote current captures to baselines.

  See 'grantiva help diff <subcommand>' for detailed help.
